=2 Walkthrough
* Return to the tombstone in {z:Caedarva Mire} for a cutscene.
* After the cutscene is over, trade your statless Mythic to the tombstone. You will now obtain the fully unlocked level 75 mythic weapon which can be further upgraded through {p:Trial of the Magians}.
* Return and examine the **Palace doors** (Imperial Whitegate) in {p:Whitegate}.
** The mythic must be in your inventory, regardless of level.
* Approach Naja to initiate a cutscene to receive 3 {i:Imperial Silver Pieces|Imperial Silver Piece|2185} and complete the quest.
** If you want to make another {p:Mythic|Mythic Weapons} then trade a new {p:Vigil Weapon|Vigil Weapons} to {n:Abquhbah} to repeat this series of {q:Mythic Quests|An Imperial Heist|Mythic Quests}. He will ask to confirm cancellation of the weapon even though it is done and return the {p:Vigil Weapon|Vigil Weapons}.
*** You may use the old base weapon to unlock the WS with the quest {p:Unlocking a Myth} if you haven't yet, or it can be stored with the NPC {n:Ghanraam} in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} at (K-10) by trading him the weapon and an {i:Imperial Bronze Piece|Imperial Bronze Piece|2184}.

